    {
      "id": "dulz9XuSQ8AcBl16GxlA4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 281.6592328369927,
      "y": 3920.403566553645,
      "width": 462,
      "height": 875,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ai",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1149685290,
      "version": 151,
      "versionNonce": 1167856042,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780619991267,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n    Purpose:\n    \n    Store every webhook received.\n    Also used for idempotency.\n\nwebhook_events\n\n    id (PK)\n    event_id\n    payment_id\n    event_type\n    payload\n    received_at\n    processing_status\n\nExample:\n    id = 1\n    event_id = evt_101\n    payment_id = pay_1\n    event_type = payment.authorized\n\nConstraint\n    UNIQUE(event_id)\n\n    This is the most important constraint.\n    Because:\n        evt_101\n        evt_101\n        evt_101\n    should be processed only once.\n\nIndex\n    UNIQUE(event_id)\n    INDEX(payment_id)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\n    Purpose:\n    \n    Store every webhook received.\n    Also used for idempotency.\n\nwebhook_events\n\n    id (PK)\n    event_id\n    payment_id\n    event_type\n    payload\n    received_at\n    processing_status\n\nExample:\n    id = 1\n    event_id = evt_101\n    payment_id = pay_1\n    event_type = payment.authorized\n\nConstraint\n    UNIQUE(event_id)\n\n    This is the most important constraint.\n    Because:\n        evt_101\n        evt_101\n        evt_101\n    should be processed only once.\n\nIndex\n    UNIQUE(event_id)\n    INDEX(payment_id)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Ulqk0fWv53XiQ3IgUFwgO",
      "type": "text",
