    {
      "id": "CljMXGRngin5IBllYQNhQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 71.69880413160081,
      "y": 10657.598241408376,
      "width": 418,
      "height": 750,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b01",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 174037366,
      "version": 64,
      "versionNonce": 1444055222,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780621505694,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "When event:\n    payment.settled\n\nappears.\nOutbox:\n    (pay_1, settled)\n    created.\nWorker triggers:\n    Reconciliation Job\n\nState Machine\n    Allowed transitions:\n    created -> authorized\n    authorized -> captured\n    captured -> settled\n    created -> failed\n    captured -> refunded\n    settled -> refunded\n\nInvalid:\n    failed -> settled\n    failed -> captured\n    settled -> authorized\n\nIf invalid:\n    Store audit log\n    Ignore event\n    ACK partner\n\nBecause retry won't fix invalid state.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "When event:\n    payment.settled\n\nappears.\nOutbox:\n    (pay_1, settled)\n    created.\nWorker triggers:\n    Reconciliation Job\n\nState Machine\n    Allowed transitions:\n    created -> authorized\n    authorized -> captured\n    captured -> settled\n    created -> failed\n    captured -> refunded\n    settled -> refunded\n\nInvalid:\n    failed -> settled\n    failed -> captured\n    settled -> authorized\n\nIf invalid:\n    Store audit log\n    Ignore event\n    ACK partner\n\nBecause retry won't fix invalid state.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "G_s2qJTqN4jUrdObmdDyk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -71.75269755716846,
      "y": 11486.202550675409,
      "width": 415.7998352050781,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
